WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.468
-Hey, everybody,
the election is two weeks away,

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:04.303
and a lot of eyes
are on Pennsylvania.

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:05.604
It's a battleground state,

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.807
and it's important
that everyone gets to vote.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.776
Well, our friend LeBron James
is doing some great work

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.944
down there with his
More Than a Vote initiative

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.279
to fight voter suppression

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.214
and make sure
everyone's vote counts.

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:17.016
But a lot of people say
the ballots in Pennsylvania

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.484
are confusing.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:19.852
So, here to help you
through the process

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:22.087
and make things easier
are Philadelphia's own

00:00:22.087 --> 00:00:23.122
The Roots.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.123
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.793
♪♪

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.149
-♪ Unh, unh ♪

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:20.280
♪♪

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:47.973
-Sorry, sorry, sorry!

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:49.508
Can we do that last part
one more time?

00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:51.811
I put the secrecy envelope
in the where?

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.680
-Uh, listen.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:07.894
-Yeah, I got it,
I got it, I got it, I got it.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:09.262
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.463
Last steps?

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.599
Tariq Trotter
and The Roots, everybody!

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.000
Make a plan!
Go vote!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.469
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody!

00:02:50.469 --> 00:02:51.471
♪♪

